sequenceDiagram
    title Saved changes in the existing KanbanFlow app
    actor Human
    participant UI as Existing editor
    participant MCP as Native or stdio MCP
    participant Save as Domain service and ChangeAudit
    participant DB as Existing SQLite database
    participant History as Shared activity readers
    Human->>UI: Save a board change
    UI->>Save: Validated mutation and actor
    MCP->>Save: Same supported mutation
    Save->>DB: Begin transaction or savepoint
    Save->>DB: Read actual prior values and deletion links
    Save->>DB: Save data, then audit with generated IDs
    alt Both writes succeed
        Save->>DB: Commit together
        DB-->>History: Retained before/after and historical context
        History-->>UI: Timeline and saved details
        History-->>MCP: Same events and older-page cursor
    else Either write fails
        Save->>DB: Roll back data and audit together
        Save-->>UI: Save failed
    end
